  "multi_level_variant": {
    "_comment": [
      "dataset.bom re-expressed in bom_multi_level shape (child material_id under",
      "parent higher_level_component_id, NO product_id), with P_OK's materials",
      "routed through the INTERMEDIATE assembly SUB_OK — so flattening root→leaf",
      "yields exactly the single-level pairs. grading_test.ts asserts the variant",
      "grades IDENTICALLY to the single-level fixture: this pins (a) the shared",
      "normalizeBomRows flatten that BOTH the browser verification and the",
      "sim-command gate run through gradeManifest, and (b) that SUB_OK — an",
      "intermediate with no supplier arc — is NOT flagged unsourced (the engine",
      "demands supplier links only for leaf materials). unsourced_bom hangs",
      "M_UNSOURCED under the intermediate: the DEEP leaf must still trace up to",
      "P_OK and raise the same materials.supplier_link block. The browser once",
      "passed bom: [] for multi-level projects, so Verify missed blocks the gate",
      "then caught; the gate's old per-edge mapping also false-blocked",
      "intermediates and missed deep leaves."
    ],
